### Goal Model for Multi-Robot Food Delivery and Dish Retrieval System

#### Goals

| Name | Text | Runtime | Goal Type | Target Condition | Relation |
|------|------|---------|-----------|------------------|----------|
| **G1** | Deliver food and retrieve dirty dishes | - | Achieve | All meals delivered and all dirty dishes retrieved | - |
| **G2** | Deliver food to the inpatient room | - | Achieve | Meal successfully delivered to the inpatient room | OR |
| **G3** | Retrieve dirty dishes from the inpatient room | - | Achieve | All dirty dishes retrieved from the inpatient room | OR |
| **G2.1** | Deliver food directly to the room table | - | Perform | Meal placed on the room table | AND |
| **G2.2** | Deliver food via robot tray | - | Perform | Meal retrieved from the robot tray | AND |
| **G2.2.1** | Patient retrieves meal from tray | - | Perform | Meal retrieved by the patient | AND |
| **G2.2.2** | Caregiver retrieves meal from tray | - | Perform | Meal retrieved by the caregiver | AND |
| **G3.1** | Robot retrieves dishes unassisted | - | Perform | Dishes retrieved by the robot | AND |
| **G3.2** | Human retrieves dishes | - | Perform | Dishes retrieved by a human | AND |

#### Tasks

| Name | Text | Relation | Location | Number of Robots |
|------|------|----------|----------|-------------------|
| **AT1** | Deliver meal to room table | AND | Inpatient room | 1 |
| **AT2** | Present tray and wait for retrieval | AND | Inpatient room | 1 |
| **AT3** | Cooperate with human for tray retrieval | AND | Inpatient room | 1-2 |
| **AT4** | Robot retrieves dishes unassisted | AND | Inpatient room | 1 |
| **AT5** | Robot retrieves dishes with another robot | AND | Inpatient room | 2 |
| **AT6** | Robot retrieves dishes when signaled by someone in the room | AND | Inpatient room | 1 |
| **AT7** | Robot cooperates with companion for dish retrieval | AND | Inpatient room | 1-2 |

### Logical Relationships

- **G1 -> G2, G3 [OR]**
- **G2 -> G2.1, G2.2 [OR]**
- **G2.2 -> G2.2.1, G2.2.2 [OR]**
- **G3 -> G3.1, G3.2 [OR]**
- **G3.1 -> AT4, AT5 [OR]**
- **G3.2 -> AT6, AT7 [OR]**
- **G2.1 -> AT1 [AND]**
- **G2.2.1 -> AT2 [AND]**
- **G2.2.2 -> AT3 [AND]**

This goal model provides a structured approach for the multi-robot system to deliver food and retrieve dirty dishes in a hospital setting, considering various scenarios and cooperation possibilities.
